### SignIn
# @name login

POST {{base-url}}/eff/eff_api/SignIn.php HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
User-Agent: {{user-agent}}

_format={{format}}
&userEmail={{user-name}}
&userPassword={{user-pass}}


### Get me
@access_token = {{login.response.body.values.token}}

### SignInfo

POST {{base-url}}/eff/eff_api/Users.php?f=SignInfo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

_format=json

### SignOut

POST {{base-url}}/eff/eff_api/Users.php?f=SignOut
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_format=json
